		    quid       	"37BD365602C0"
		    documentation 	
|Empty Constructor (for newInstance Method).
|	 * Does not create Dummy Objects for it's Constituents.
|	 * So those Objects are not well-defined, but contain Null Pointers.	 
		    
		    concurrency 	"Sequential"
